We welcome your feedback, questions, and suggestions. Whether you’ve identified an issue, need help with your account, or have an idea to improve the platform, we encourage you to get in touch.

## **General Inquiries & Support**

**Email:** contact@serplora.com

Please use this email for:

- **Content corrections** – Report errors or inaccuracies in our tutorials so we can address them promptly.
- **Feature requests** – Suggest new topics, tools, or improvements you would like to see.
- **Technical issues** – Report bugs or problems you encounter while using the compiler or platform.
- **Billing & General questions** – Any other platform-related feedback or subscription help.

## **Privacy & Legal Requests**

**Email:** privacy@serplora.com

Please use this email for:

- **Account Deletion** – Submit requests to permanently delete your account and associated data.
- **Data Rights** – Submit GDPR, CCPA, or other regional data access and correction requests.
- **Policy Questions** – Inquiries regarding our Terms of Service or Privacy Policy.

**Operating Jurisdiction:** California, USA

We aim to review general support messages as soon as possible. For formal privacy, data, and account deletion requests, please allow up to 30 days for processing.

Thank you for your interest in Serplora Academy.
